1
00:00:14,928 --> 00:00:18,596
Excuse-moi, où est la boulangerie ?
Excuse me, where is the bakery?

2
00:00:18,696 --> 00:00:22,220
Elle est là, près de la place.
It’s there, near the square.

3
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:25,244
On continue tout droit ?
Do we keep going straight ahead?

4
00:00:25,344 --> 00:00:28,628
Oui, puis tourne à gauche.
Yes, then turn left.

5
00:00:28,728 --> 00:00:31,748
Le café est à droite ?
Is the café on the right?

6
00:00:31,848 --> 00:00:36,284
Non, il est devant le musée, pas derrière.
No, it’s in front of the museum, not behind it.

7
00:00:36,384 --> 00:00:39,284
La gare est loin d’ici ?
Is the station far from here?

8
00:00:39,384 --> 00:00:44,660
Non, elle est près d’ici. Tourne à droite.
No, it’s near here. Turn right.
